th-to-node=3D"6" data-index-in-node=3D"0">1. The Missing "Startup/Compensat=
ion" Filter</b>
Because you are at the pre-seed stage, your biggest risk right now is inter=
viewing phenomenal engineers who ultimately demand a $200k base salary that=
 you cannot support.</p><ul data-path-to-node=3D"7"><li><p data-path-to-nod=
