r the core web app, while mentioning Go specifically for high-performance b=
ot services. However, your screening questions specifically ask about years=
 of experience with <b data-path-to-node=3D"7,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"44=
9">Go</b>, but not Node/TypeScript.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"7,1=
,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"7,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Suggestion:</b>=
 If the day-to-day work is 80% TypeScript/Node and 20% Go, you might want t=
o swap that question to ask about TypeScript/Node.js experience, or simply =
add a second question for it.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=3D"8"><b da=
ta-path-to-node=3D"8" data-index-in-node=3D"0">3. Timezone / Geographic Con=
straints</b>
